@startuml experiment_submit_frontend
!theme plain
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 140
skinparam wrapWidth 200
title Experiment submit (1/3) — validation, enqueue and the custom-script path

actor User
participant "Setup Page\n(Streamlit)" as Setup
participant "api_client\n(httpx)" as Client
participant "FastAPI\n/app.py" as API
participant "db.py\n(SQLite WAL)" as DB

== Form fill & validate ==
User -> Setup: fill tabs (env, algos, params, budget, ...)
Setup -> Setup: coerce values\n(bound checks, type casts)
User -> Setup: click "Validate"
Setup -> Client: POST /experiments/validate\n{ExperimentSpec}
Client -> API: HTTP POST
API -> API: validate_spec(spec)\n(table-driven: env, algo, params, budget, ...)
API --> Client: 200 {ok, errors[], warnings[]}
Client --> Setup: ValidationReport
Setup --> User: render errors/warnings by tab

== Submit ==
User -> Setup: click "Submit"
Setup -> Client: POST /experiments\n{ExperimentSpec}
Client -> API: HTTP POST
API -> API: validate_spec(spec) (defense in depth)
note right of API: 422 if invalid
API -> DB: insert_experiment(spec, status="queued")
DB --> API: experiment_id
API --> Client: 201 {id, status="queued", position}
Client --> Setup: SubmitResponse
Setup --> User: success toast + navigate to Queue

== Submit (custom script — Setup -> Advanced) ==
note over Setup, API: gated by DEAP_ENABLE_ADVANCED (else 403)
User -> Setup: Advanced tab -> paste script -> "Submit to queue"
Setup -> Client: POST /experiments/script {script, label}
Client -> API: HTTP POST
API -> API: validate_script_source(script)\n(ast.parse + structural checks)
note right of API: 422 {ok:false, issues} if syntax error
API -> DB: insert_experiment(\n  {kind:"script", environment:"(custom script)", script}, queued)
DB --> API: experiment_id
API --> Client: 201 {id, status="queued", position}

note over User
  Fragment of <i>sequence_experiment_submit.puml</i>.
  Steps and participants outside this
  fragment are omitted.
end note

@enduml
